00:25:22.027 --> 00:25:22.860
So what do we offer?

00:25:22.860 --> 00:25:28.050
So we provide a suite of APIs
called the Google Maps APIs.

00:25:28.050 --> 00:25:30.960
And Google has been
investing heavily

00:25:30.960 --> 00:25:32.430
in building up a
consumer mapping

00:25:32.430 --> 00:25:35.250
platform over the
past decade to build

00:25:35.250 --> 00:25:38.970
the most accurate and
comprehensive representation

00:25:38.970 --> 00:25:40.800
