00:25:40.800 --> 00:25:44.130
We have made that platform
available to developers

00:25:44.130 --> 00:25:48.570
with a suite of nearly
20 APIs that allow you

00:25:48.570 --> 00:25:51.240
access to the
underlying location data

00:25:51.240 --> 00:25:54.610
that powers Google's
mapping products.

00:25:54.610 --> 00:25:59.050
So these APIs are a set
